WEBVTT

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.056
But then and only then
can we actually address

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.736
and confront this legacy of slavery

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:37.176
and dismantle this ugly legacy of slavery.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.456
Thank you very much.

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:41.960
(Applause)